config ARM64_EFI_MEMMAP_SIZE
	int "Size of the UEFI memory map buffer"
	depends on BUILD_OUTPUT_EFI
	default 8192
	help
	  The EFI stub stores the UEFI memory map in a buffer of this size
	  before calling ExitBootServices(). arm64_efi_boot_info_get() returns
	  it. The stub returns to UEFI with an error if the map does not fit.
